+- [ ] T024 [US2] Add the cost-band and salt tests to `tests/test_password.py`: `test_fr073_one_verification_costs_between_10ms_and_200ms` (time one read of a protected snippet against one read of an unprotected one on the same host; assert the difference falls in 10–200 ms), `test_fr073_salt_is_unique_per_snippet`, and `test_fr073_identical_passwords_have_different_stored_forms` (two snippets published with the same password differ in both `salt` and `hash`, read straight off disk).
+- [ ] T025 [US2] Add `test_fr074_verification_does_not_delay_other_snippets` to `tests/test_password.py`: overlap several reads of a protected snippet with reads of a *different* unprotected snippet and assert the latter complete without waiting for the former (FR-074, FR-042, SC-021).
